{"id":46402,"date":"2025-11-09T01:03:42","date_gmt":"2025-11-09T00:03:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46402"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:19:01","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:19:01","slug":"meia-maratona-de-napoles-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-napoles-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de N\u00e1poles 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A\u00a0<strong>Meia Maratona de N\u00e1poles 2026<\/strong>\u00a0(oficialmente Napoli City Half Marathon) realiza-se no dia\u00a0<strong>22 de fevereiro de 2026<\/strong>\u00a0e \u00e9 considerada a meia maratona mais r\u00e1pida de It\u00e1lia.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O percurso de\u00a0<strong>21,097 km<\/strong>\u00a0\u00e9 praticamente plano e r\u00e1pido, ideal para bater recordes pessoais. A corrida inicia-se na\u00a0<strong>Piazza Tecchio<\/strong>\u00a0e segue ao longo da costa mediterr\u00e2nea, oferecendo vistas espetaculares do\u00a0<strong>Monte Ves\u00favio<\/strong>\u00a0e da Ba\u00eda de N\u00e1poles. Ao longo do trajeto, os participantes passam por monumentos emblem\u00e1ticos como o\u00a0<strong>Castel dell&#8217;Ovo<\/strong>, o porto, e o centro hist\u00f3rico da cidade<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46403,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46402","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-napoles-italia","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-italia"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.co